WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:01.840
On the road south

00:01.920 --> 00:02.920
Won't be peaceful

00:03.000 --> 00:04.400
Tonight

00:04.480 --> 00:05.840
Rest well

00:05.920 --> 00:07.840
Your Highness has the will to pacify the world

00:07.920 --> 00:09.160
And the ability to rule it

00:09.240 --> 00:10.640
I think

00:10.960 --> 00:11.600
Heaven's mandate

00:11.680 --> 00:13.960
Will definitely be on Your Highness's side

